{"id":"sospechoso","lemma":"sospechoso","pos":"adj","rank":1021,"glosses":["suspicious, suspect, fishy, shady, sketchy","shifty"],"ipa":"/sospeˈt͡ʃoso/","forms":{"feminine":"sospechosa","masculinePlural":"sospechosos","femininePlural":"sospechosas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-sospechoso.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Tom es un sospechoso?","en":"Is Tom a suspect?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799206"},{"text":"Ese equipo está realizando una operación sospechosa.","en":"That outfit is running a fly-by-night operation."},{"text":"Ambos se veían sospechosos.","en":"Both of them seem suspicious."},{"text":"Él es sospechoso de robo.","en":"He is suspected of robbery.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704433"},{"text":"La manera en que ella nos habló fue sospechosa.","en":"The way she spoke to us was suspicious."}]}